# Static-host routing for the Lekishi artifact.
#
# A chapter is prerendered to `chapters/<chapter-id>.html`, which a static host
# serves at the clean URL `/chapters/<chapter-id>`. Do not rewrite the clean URL
# to the `.html` file: Pages redirects that file back to its clean URL, creating a
# loop.
# A trailing slash redirects to the clean URL rather than rewriting to the same
# file: the prerendered page references its assets relatively, so serving it at
# `/chapters/<chapter-id>/` would resolve them under that directory and the page
# would not load.
/chapters/tang-mission-750-754/ /chapters/tang-mission-750-754 308
/chapters/qin-conquest-han-233-226/ /chapters/qin-conquest-han-233-226 308

# The legacy routes. `/atlas` was the launch chapter's own route and
# `/compare/qin` the second chapter's review route; both now redirect to the
# chapter they served, and their redirect pages are in the artifact as well so
# the rule and the page agree.
/atlas/ /atlas 308
